      "title": "Hind Aluminium Industries Limited (BSE:531979) agreed to acquire Aluminium business of Nirav Commercials Limited from Nirav Commercials Limited (BSE:512425) for INR 12.5 million.",
      "body": "Hind Aluminium Industries Limited (BSE:531979) agreed to acquire Aluminium business of Nirav Commercials Limited from Nirav Commercials Limited (BSE:512425) for INR 12.5 million on February 4, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 12.5 million will be paid by Hind Aluminium Industries Limited. As part of consideration, INR 12.5 million is paid towards assets of Aluminium business of Nirav Commercials Limited.\n\nFor the period ended March 31, 2025, Aluminium business of Nirav Commercials Limited reported a total revenue of INR 97.26 million. \n\nThe deal is conditional upon the approval of merger agreement from target board and obtain approval of the Acquirer Board of Directors and Audit Committee. The deal has been approved by the board. The Board is of the opinion that the aforesaid proposal is ",
